    <uiOrder>2804</uiOrder>
    <researchPrerequisites>
      <li>Stonecutting</li>
    </researchPrerequisites>
    <description>A lavender Serenite wall lamp.\n\nSupports tranquility in an enclosed room: room support adds comfort to beds and seats and mood while present, and with Solar energy also faster sleep. Each fixture type counts once. No fuel or electricity.</description>
